# DevGraph configuration
#
# Every variable here is OPTIONAL. With an empty environment DevGraph runs
# fully: ingestion, analysis, all ten graph views, metrics, and deterministic
# architecture insights. Setting a variable adds a capability; nothing is
# required to boot, and no key is ever sent to the browser.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raises GitHub's anonymous rate limit (60 → 5,000 requests/hour) and is used
# read-only. A classic token with NO scopes is enough for public repositories.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI insights (OpenRouter)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Absent: the deterministic insight engine is used and the UI says so.
# Present: "Expand with AI" streams a model-written version of each section.
# The model receives a factual digest of the analysis, never your source.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=anthropic/claude-3.5-haiku
# OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Persistence (PostgreSQL / Supabase)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Absent: results live in an in-memory LRU cache scoped to the process.
# Present: results are gzipped and stored; the schema is created on first use.
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/devgraph

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Authentication (Clerk)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Absent: the app is fully usable anonymously and every analysis is public to
# the instance. Present: signed-in users get a private analysis history.
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local directory analysis
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Off by default. Only enable on an instance you control — it lets the server
# read directories on its own filesystem.
# DEVGRAPH_ALLOW_LOCAL=false
# DEVGRAPH_LOCAL_ROOTS=/Users/you/code:/srv/repos

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Limits
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DEVGRAPH_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=10
# DEVGRAPH_MAX_UPLOAD_MB=120

# Used for absolute URLs in metadata.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://devgraph.example.com
